//RS /// D-ONELINE-BODY1=B — one body rule *(ratified 2026-08-13, cards #1453 and
//RS /// #1454)*: "An effect-only `if` or `loop` may put `->` before one adjacent
//RS /// statement; braces are required for multiple statements and scoped marker
//RS /// blocks." This fixture predates that (added 2026-07-27, f71f39648) and wrote
//RS /// brace-less, arrow-less `if cond stmt`, which is E0372.
