//RS /// D-LOOP-HEADER3=D — one three-slot header meaning *(ratified 2026-07-31,
//RS /// card #1325)*: "slots are binding; source; step rule … The C-style counter
//RS /// form retires with a teaching diagnostic." `counted_init_exit` used
//RS /// `loop i := init, cond, step {}`, which is E0376 (the retired three-slot form)
